#: libkdcraw/dcrawsettingswidget.cpp:272
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p><b>Quality (interpolation)</b><p>Select here the demosaicing method to "
"use when decoding RAW images. A demosaicing algorithm is a digital image "
"process used to interpolate a complete image from the partial raw data "
"received from the color-filtered image sensor, internal to many digital "
"cameras, in form of a matrix of colored pixels. Also known as CFA "
"interpolation or color reconstruction, another common spelling is "
"demosaicing. The following methods are available for demosaicing RAW images:"
"<p><b>Bilinear</b>: use high-speed but low-quality bilinear interpolation "
"(default - for slow computers). In this method, the red value of a non-red "
"pixel is computed as the average of the adjacent red pixels, and similarly "
"for blue and green.<p><b>VNG</b>: use Variable Number of Gradients "
"interpolation. This method computes gradients near the pixel of interest and "
"uses the lower gradients (representing smoother and more similar parts of "
"the image) to make an estimate.<p><b>PPG</b>: use Patterned-Pixel-Grouping "
"interpolation. Pixel Grouping uses assumptions about natural scenery in "
"making estimates. It has fewer color artifacts on natural images than the "
"Variable Number of Gradients method.<p><b>AHD</b>: use Adaptive Homogeneity-"
"Directed interpolation. This method selects the direction of interpolation "
"so as to maximize a homogeneity metric, thus typically minimizing color "
"artifacts.<p><b>DCB</b>: DCB interpolation from linuxphoto.org project."
"<p><b>AHD v2</b>: modified AHD interpolation using Variance of Color "
"Differences method.<p><b>AFD</b>: Adaptive Filtered Demosaicing "
"interpolation through 5 pass median filter from PerfectRaw project."
"<p><b>VCD</b>: Variance of Color Differences interpolation.<p><b>VCD & AHD</"
"b>: Mixed demosaicing between VCD and AHD.<p><b>LMMSE</b>: color demosaicing "
"via directional linear minimum mean-square error estimation interpolation "
"from PerfectRaw.<p><b>AMaZE</b>: Aliasing Minimization interpolation and "
"Zipper Elimination to apply color aberration removal from RawTherapee "
"project.<p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Quality (interpolation)</b><p>Odaberite ovdje interpolacijski metod "
"demozaično dekodiranje RAW slike  Demozaični algoritam algoritam je proces "
"digitalne slike koji se koristi za interpolaciju potpune slike od "
"djelomičnih sirovih podataka primljenih od senzora boje filtrirane slike "
"ugrađenog u mnoge digitalne fotoaparati u obliku matrice obojenih piksela. "
"Takođe je poznat kao CFA interpolacija ili rekonstrukcija boja, zove se i "
"demozaik. Postoje 4 metode demozaika RAW slike:<p><b>Bilinearno</b>: "
"koristiti vrlo brzu, ali niske kvalitete bilinearnu interpolacija (zadano - "
"za spore računare). U ovoj metodi, crvena vrijednost ne-crvenog piksela se "
"izračunava kao prosjek susjednih crvenih piksela, i slično za plavo i zeleno."
"<p><b>VNG</b>: Koristite interpolaciju promjenjivim broje gradijenta "
"interpolacija. Ova metoda izračunava gradijent u blizini piksel koji se "
"prati i koristi manji gradijent (predstavljajući glatke i više sličnije "
"dijelove slike) za procijenu.<p><b>PPG</b>: Koristi grupnu interpolaciju "
"piksela u uzorku. Piksel grupiranje koristi pretpostavke o prirodnoj sceni u "
"izradi procjene. In ima manje artefakata boja na prirodnoj slici od  metode "
"promjenjivog broja gradijenata.<p><b>AHD</b>: koristiti Adaptivno homogenu "
"upravljanu interpolaciju. Ova metoda odabire smjer interpolacije kako bi se "
"povećala  metrika homogenost, čime se obično smanjuju artefakati boje.<p>"

#: libkdcraw/dcrawsettingswidget.cpp:329
msgid "Pass:"
msgstr ""

#: libkdcraw/dcrawsettingswidget.cpp:330
msgid ""
"<p><b>Pass</b><p>Set here the passes used by the median filter applied after "
"interpolation to Red-Green and Blue-Green channels.<p>This setting is only "
"available for specific Quality options: <b>Bilinear</b>, <b>VNG</b>, <b>PPG</"
"b>, <b>AHD</b>, <b>DCB</b>, and <b>VCD & AHD</b>.<p>"
msgstr ""

#: libkdcraw/dcrawsettingswidget.cpp:340
msgid "Refine interpolation"
msgstr ""

#: libkdcraw/dcrawsettingswidget.cpp:341
msgid ""
"<p><b>Refine interpolation</b><p>This setting is available only for few "
"Quality options:<p><b>DCB</b>: turn on the enhance interpolated colors "
"filter.<p><b>VCD & AHD</b>: turn on the enhanced effective color "
"interpolation (EECI) refine to improve sharpness.<p>"
msgstr ""

